# Normalize text to LF in the repository and in every checkout, including
# Windows: the HTTP code and tests compare exact bytes ("\r\n" is written
# explicitly), so a checkout must never rewrite line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never convert, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
# No data file in this repository needs an exact hash today; add `-text` here
# for any fixture whose bytes must be preserved exactly.
